257
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,900
It isn't like that cold was a big test.

258
00:12:32,560 --> 00:12:36,440
Speaking of, your sister's studying for entrance exams, so I hope you didn't get her sick.

259
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:38,920
Huh.

260
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:39,000
Hmm.

261
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:39,060
Hmm.

262
